<title>FINLAND: TABLE - NOVO PROFIT UP 62 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - NOVO PROFIT UP 62 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   23.0 vs 14.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    3.0 vs 1.7</p>
<p> Net sales					  576.7 vs 575.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  22.3 vs 14.3</p>
<p> Return on equity ROE (percent)		17.0 vs 14.7</p>
<p> Return on investment ROI (percent)	  20.5 vs 20.1</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    49.5 vs 34.9</p>
<p>NOTES - Full name of Finnish data systems group is Novo Oy.</p>
<p>- The group said the result development was expected</p>
<p>to remain positive during the rest of the year 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248, news@reuters.fi</p>
